{"id":235815,"name":"Ocean Blue 10 / 404","headline":"Fresh & Fabulous 2BDR - 5 min to Airport","summary":"This fabulous 2 bedroom designer apartment is located inside a very unique gated complex , 5 minutes to Cairo International Airport.","description":{"Space":"\n\r\n very fast fiber optic WiFi and 24 hour security surveillance.\r\nThis apartment is perfect for families and business travelers. The apartment includes a spacious reception area with a combined living and dining room along with a fully equipped modern kitchen, cooking utensils and a coffee machine. The living room is furnished with a sofa set along with a 55 inch smart TV with Chromecast and AirPlay built-in for further personal entertainment. \r\nThere are two bedrooms (one with a king size bed and the other with two single beds) and two bathrooms (one full bathroom with a bath tub shower and a guest bathroom)\r\nPlease note the following: \r\n- Smoking is only allowed outside the building (a fine of $100 will be imposed when smoking indoors) \r\n- Visitors are not allowed, only confirmed guests will be granted entry. \r\n- Free of charge street parking is available. \r\n\r\n","Access":"\r\n\r\nGuests have access to the entire apartment. \r\n\r\n","Interaction":"\r\nGuests can text and call anytime they need help and i can be there in about 30 mins to solve any issue immediately.\r\n\r\n","Neighborhood":"\r\n-Cafés and restaurants are along Ankara street which is about a 10 minute walk from the complex.\r\n- Banks and other services are also within walking distance (inside Sun City Mall)\r\n- Sun City Mall (banks and shopping) and Cairo Complex (for dining options) are within a 5 minute walking distance. \r\n- Giza Pyramids is a 50 min drive\r\n- Downtown Cairo is a 30 min drive \r\n- New Cairo is a 15 min drive\r\n- Cairo International Airport is a 5 min drive.\r\n\r\n","Transit":"\r\nWe provide concierge services that include airport transfers and private day tours. \r\nAll places are reachable by car, Uber app and Careem app but if you wish to take a walk it's takes no more than 5 minutes to reach any of the services around.\r\n\r\n","Notes":"\r\nPlease note the following: \r\n-PLEASE NOTE: Check-in time is at 3:00 PM, and our team is unavailable between 1:00 AM and 10:00 AM.\r\n-  20% discount applied on long stay starting from 1month.\r\n- Smoking is only allowed outside the building (a fine of $100 will be imposed when smoking indoors) \r\n- Visitors are not allowed, only confirmed guests will be granted entry. \r\n- Free of charge street parking is available. "},"city":"Cairo","capacity_of_guests":4,"number_of_bedrooms":2,"number_of_beds":4,"number_of_bathrooms":2,"number_of_stars":5,"location_address1":"Ocean Blue Heliopolis","location_address2":"Building number 10, Apartment 404","location_lat":"30.0990257","location_lng":"31.383786","booking_link":null,"airbnb_link":null,"rental_type":"apartment","featured":false,"cleaning_fee":25,"checkin_time":15,"checkout_time":11,"booking_sync_cleaning_fee_id":465257,"active":1,"can_book":1,"agreement":"• Kindly note that a damage deposit of USD 150 (or the equivalent in EGP) is required. The payment is collected online as part of the reservation payment and will be reimbursed on the checkout day, provided no damages are incurred.\r\n• Smoking (including shisha) inside the unit is strictly not allowed. However it is allowed in the\r\nunit’s balcony (if applicable). A fine of $100 may be imposed in case of smoking indoors.\r\n• Partying, excessive noise and public alcohol drinking is not allowed. In case of violations, security\r\nwill be notified and appropriate strict actions will be taken.\r\n• Please note that this studio is located in a local and modest neighborhood. Guests staying should\r\nexpect that the surrounding areas to the building are not of high standards. However, the studio\r\napartment is highly well maintained and sparkling clean as shown in the photos\r\n• Visitors are not allowed, only confir